OL,3,GNEWSAChild seriously injured in fall
OL,4,Afrom window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy has been seriously injured in
OL,7,Ffall from a window.
OL,9,FPolice received reports at 16:16 BST on
OL,10,FSaturday about concern over the welfare
OL,11,Fof a child on Spotland Tops in
OL,12,FRochdale.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended the scene
OL,15,Fand the child was taken to hospital for
OL,16,Ftreatment, where he remains in a
OL,17,Fcritical condition.
OL,19,FGreater Manchester Police said
OL,20,Finquiries into the full circumstances
OL,21,Faround the incident were ongoing.
